{"server":"tw","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_st04","groupId":"act38side","stageId":"act38side_st04","title":"《管理法修正案》","storyCode":"PV-ST-4","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_st04.txt","sourceHash":"a7675a94a70ba9201295de38a0e4887f20e0e4693d021e48c9f8988c728b30d2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g4_newvolsiniialley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅不明白……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的狼崽子，這次我不會放過你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"昨晚廣場上的事情塵埃落定，狂歡節的最後，柳德米拉瞥見了這熟悉的紅色身影。\n柳德米拉一路跟著她，看著她穿過一條又一條巷子，時而走到死路再折返，時而長久地停在原地……像是完全沒有目的地。\n柳德米拉找好了最佳的伏擊位置，等候機會出手。一擊即中。\n柳德米拉壓制住她，刀抵在對方的心臟處，只要輕輕一送，便能為老師報仇，了結這個一次次出現在自己面前的幽靈。\n但紅色的魯珀完全沒有還手的意思，她只是愣愣地跪在地上，喃喃著什麼。\n柳德米拉終於看清了對方的眼睛，空洞又無神的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……真狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆才是真狼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅和他們一樣，只是被真狼選中的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"我們替真狼狩獵，替真狼去死，替真狼贏得勝利……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"故事是假的，外婆也是假的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"都是假的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說你們的遊戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，老師她瘸著一條腿，一輩子東躲西藏，只是因為她參與到了這樣一場荒唐的遊戲裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為了所謂的“勝利”殺死了她？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……紅不明白——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"柳德米拉突然感受到了來自對方的力量，刀鋒刺入衣物的聲音清晰可聞。\n她退開了一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的凱爾希就是這麼教你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暴力、仇恨、理想、命運……你的凱爾希不是總有一套道理嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希……凱爾希……"},{"type":"narration","text":"跪在雨中的紅衣魯珀在身上摸索著，良久，她從柳德米拉的刀剛剛刺入的位置摸出了一顆牙齒。\n尖尖的、短短的牙齒，上面刀的劃痕清晰可見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乳牙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆告訴紅，這種牙齒沒辦法撕咬獵物，所以會掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"但紅一直留著它……紅不知道為什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希說，在紅知道答案之前，紅應該自己保管好它……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅沒有聽凱爾希的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我發現了那個拿著獵弓的女孩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我查看了她的傷口，你最後那一刀避開了要害，她沒死，我救下了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這人渣，原來也會對自己的所作所為產生懷疑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想見你的凱爾希嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默地晃動耳朵）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我倒想問問她，這一切到底是怎麼回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那之前，你別想死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更別想髒了我的刀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomA"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是新沃爾西尼執法者的作風？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托先生，要說幾遍你才相信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的律師探視申請完全符合規定，並沒有問題，而且我們確實也已經通知了薩盧佐酒業，但沒有人過來……並不是我們在從中作梗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要見你們的負責人，不，我要見拉維妮婭大法官，或者萊昂圖索市長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警察","speakerId":"avg_npc_1553_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"午安，先生，看起來你睡得很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒，你已經被永久驅逐出了薩盧佐家族，你沒有資格來救我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，你還真是自作多情啊，老東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有說我是來救你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隔著牢房的鐵窗，拉普蘭德丟進來一個包裝得異常精美的禮盒。\n阿爾貝托沒有伸手去接，禮盒落地散開，露出裡面嶄新的套裝，俐落的剪裁，異常華麗的刺繡，比拉普蘭德身上的這套有過之而無不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，本來是送你的狂歡節禮服，這可是出自敘拉古名匠之手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年我們已經道別過了，我親愛的父親，所以我沒有打算再見你，我更願意把時間花在更有意思的事情上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我畢竟是個知恩圖報的人，受了你這麼久的教誨，起碼也該補上一份道別禮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但誰叫跑腿的小裁縫陰差陽錯地惹上了麻煩呢，最後還是得我自己跑這一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，狂歡節已經圓滿結束了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，也不可惜，看看你現在的樣子，你正好缺一套囚服，哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在試圖以這樣的方式激怒我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這沒有用，拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明那麼聰慧，卻為何總是如此幼稚？薩盧佐家的每一個成員都知道，阿爾貝托·薩盧佐從不做錯誤的決定——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，來都來了，我就順便告訴你另外一件事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能要在這裡面……待上很久喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g12_saluzzowinery"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族法務","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經進行了表決，拉普蘭德小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族法務","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你做過多少錯事，你畢竟是老爺唯一的女兒，薩盧佐家族唯一的繼承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族法務","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你暫時主持家族事務，當務之急是應對市政廳在狂歡節之後對薩盧佐酒業的深入調查，以及，將老爺救出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我只是進來喝一杯而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒記錯的話，新沃爾西尼可是不存在家族的，你們確定還要玩家族傳承這一套嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族法務","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，老傢伙進去之前，不是已經指定了人選嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族法務","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼想，該救你們於危難的，都應該是這位薩盧佐酒業的第一合夥人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的職責所在，拉普蘭德小姐……以及，薩盧佐家的各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照《新都市管理法案》，即刻對我們在這座城市的所有產業進行自查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若阿爾貝托先生除了違規註冊之外，還操控薩盧佐酒業參與了一些不該參與的事情，那我們就應該整理證據，主動向市政廳檢舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，我會重新整合薩盧佐酒業的管理層。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為了保下薩盧佐酒業，這實屬無奈之舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來真辛苦，敬你一杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"家族法務","speakerId":"avg_npc_1554_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomA"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝洛內家的怎麼敢在這個時候……還是說，他從一開始就在打這個主意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德，你這是坐視薩盧佐在新沃爾西尼的產業被貝洛內給——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，我可是在遵循你的意志，我“已經被永久驅逐出了薩盧佐家族”，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你篤定我隨時會像遷徙的羽獸一樣飛回來，守護你的老巢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實一直有一個疑問，父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是當初在布魯奈羅城我想要殺死巨狼之口成員時，還是在哥倫比亞我放走德克薩斯，你那麼生氣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟是在氣憤我損害了家族的利益，違背了敘拉古的規矩，還是僅僅是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在告訴所有人，原來有些事情竟然是阿爾貝托·薩盧佐控制不了的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，你還是省點力氣想想該怎麼應付接下來的庭審吧，畢竟薩盧佐酒業的新老闆可不會允許自己的律師團隊為你出庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是個無聊的蠢人，我親愛的父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這下是真的再見了，對了，記得開心一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_1038_whitw2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，你擁有比所有人都華麗的囚服。哈哈哈哈……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g2_newvolsiniistreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你怎麼還沒結束？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道市政廳的那幫公務員是怎麼評估的，一樣的積分、一樣的社區服務，憑什麼我要比你多清理兩條街？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說話客氣一點，甘比諾。別忘了你那天晚上莫名其妙暈倒在巷子裡，是我救了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說了嗎，威尼斯載具公司幾乎有一半的高層管理者都被條子請去喝茶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，被送進老威尼斯房間的，除了雪茄和唱片，還有威尼斯載具公司一年來所有的業務往來和人員資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有和小威尼斯牽扯過深的成員都被挑了出來。第二天一早，那厚厚的一疊自檢資料就出現在了市政廳的辦公桌上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老威尼斯切割得太及時、太決絕，市政廳挑不出什麼毛病。威尼斯載具公司徹底重整，但不會被裁撤，小威尼斯的影響被降到了最低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換到新沃爾西尼，家族清洗叛徒的方式都這麼……別開生面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老傢伙都老成那樣子了，居然還那麼狠。一開始我還真以為他就是來過節的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是聽你的繼續留在那裡，我們兩個現在大概已經在吃牢飯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼區別嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的市民積分已經歸零，我們要從頭存起……我們再一次一無所有了，卡彭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不算一無所有吧……"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡彭看向路口，那裡停著一輛熟悉的黃色計程車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德說，這輛車就留給我們了……算是報酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭，你說我們要花多久的時間，才能在這座城市開起一家計程車公司？到時候名字就叫“西西里”，你覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我覺得我們得先躲一躲，那個法官過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，她好像不是來找我們的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算就這麼一聲不吭地走掉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就不在城裡繼續逗留了吧，免得你又寢食難安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？有好一陣子沒去看麗薩那孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難得了結了一樁陳年舊事，有了時間也有了心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是來敘舊的，英格麗女士，你我本來也不熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在今天上午，老威尼斯專程來見了我和萊昂圖索一面……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯家族的事情已與我無關——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他願意付出一切代價為威尼斯載具公司保下哪怕一間工廠，但他還提出了一個請求——讓你安全地離開新沃爾西尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到小威尼斯在狂歡節當晚的所作所為，你的行為一定程度上幫助市政廳遏止了暴亂——我們確實應該酌情考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你的蓄意傷害罪依然成立，而且這是一場家族內部的復仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會同時發布你的通緝令，英格麗女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通緝令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我身上還背著好幾份家族的懸賞呢，甚至還有西西里夫人的禁令……如今再加上一份通緝令，也算沒有白回來一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別那麼無所謂，英格麗女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份通緝令的效力來自《新都市管理法案》，它不像西西里夫人的禁令，會因為哪個家族的得勢或失勢而出現斡旋的餘地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法律就是法律，英格麗女士，我們之前聊過類似的話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新沃爾西尼……未來，甚至是整個敘拉古，將隨時留意你的動向，直到你被捉拿歸案，這份通緝令才會因此失效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你來提醒我，拉維妮婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我並沒有對你今天的表態感到“無所謂”，那天在酒莊我就看出來了，你是個很堅定的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我印象中的敘拉古，殺一個人往往是不需要理由的。但其實不應該是這樣，任何人做任何事都需要理由，對的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個法官是這樣，一個母親是這樣……哪怕一個殺手也應該是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認可你的理由，所以我認可你做的事情。更何況我說過，我對你的職業沒什麼特別的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，你發布了對我的通緝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那我到底該不該期待和你再見呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"英格麗","speakerId":"avg_4026_vulpis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g14_governmentoffice_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你來了，伊雷妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂圖索先生，您的身體好一點了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。謝謝你的關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，請您看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……辭呈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我申請辭去卡車工會主席的職務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年前，我向您和拉維妮婭法官承諾過，不會有任何家族的人能夠滲透進卡車工會……但我沒有做到，我對不起你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實阻止了他們將自己的人安插進工會，但這一點都沒妨礙他們達成自己的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索默爾，還有那些被利用的成員……我也對不起他們。而這些事情暴露後，我卻想要要挾拉維妮婭法官……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錯不在你，至少不全在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人能在好友身死，自己和身邊人也被家族逼到絕路時還保持冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且從結果看，你並沒有釀成大錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我，但我沒辦法原諒自己……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在你來之前，我收到了一封聯名信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信中請求不要追究你在狂歡節期間的過失，卡車工會兩百多名正式司機，還有好幾百名臨時工和約聘人員都在上面簽了名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們？他們不應該這樣的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收回你的辭職信，伊雷妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下週市政廳會召開內部聽證會，探討將卡車工會納入市政系統，與城建局、警察局成為同級部門的可能性。"},{"type":"narration","text":"4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊雷妮，我們將一起建設新沃爾西尼的物流系統，一起建設這座新城市……或許我們會成為很好的同事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是堅信我和拉維妮婭的判斷，你或許並不是卡車工會主席的最佳人選，但你是個善良的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醒來的這兩天，我已經瞭解了我錯過的所有事情，也想了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找定一個方向並不難，難的是怎麼走完它。我們的路還很長，很長很長，伊雷妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g6_courtsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出來了。怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"互助會接下來要配合調查，而且基本的處罰免不了……但市政廳不會追究狂歡節的事情，和那些參與了家族走私的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，柳德米拉，我不是讓你在營地等我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來跟你告別的。等你回到營地再說的話，那些傢伙大概又要鬧上好一陣子，很麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你要離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了那個紅色的傢伙，她的情況有點糟糕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是你的仇人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。她需要回到一個人的身邊，而那個人，是我的另一個仇人，我早晚也要去見她一面……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這事情一言難盡，總之，既然卡車互助會暫時不會有什麼事，我想去一個叫羅德島的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在離開前，我有事情要問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":"avg_1502_crosly_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂歡節的那個晚上，當你命令我們將武器對準威尼斯的人時……你究竟在想什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，只要殺了對面這些混蛋，卡車互助會惹上的所有麻煩，便都不復存在了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管有多少人參與了走私，又走私了什麼，都將成為永遠的秘密？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的身後站著這麼多人，我們有這麼多武器，我有自信能做到這件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有自信即使這樣做了，也不會有責任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那一刻，你究竟是想保護身後的大家，還是，感受到了自己也像對面那些混蛋一樣……掌控了很多人的命運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而促使你停下來的，究竟是那一聲唐突的銃響，還是，一些更深遠的判斷？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不用急著否認，伊雷妮，所有的答案，都只有你自己知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你們說過塔露拉的故事。我見過一個曾經那麼讓人敬佩的領袖成為了惡龍，而在當時，我沒能發現，也沒能殺了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會盯著你，伊雷妮，我是懸在你頭頂的劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你變成那樣，不管我身處何處，我都會出現……殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柳德米拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我希望永遠不會有那一天，我希望我們真誠地祝福彼此……我的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g6_courtsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊雷妮的身邊已經空了，總是眉頭緊鎖的瑞柏巴不知何時已經離開。\n深秋的夜風已經很涼了，但伊雷妮只是發愣地站著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山德羅，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊雷妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯名信的事情……謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉普蘭德，你不是答應了德克薩斯，要將我們帶離敘拉古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，我騙她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，那場賭局真的是她贏了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，扎羅，狂歡節結束了嗎？還是說，它已經重新開始了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"威尼斯家那隻老狼磨去了爪牙，重新融入了狼群，而那隻叫伊雷妮的狼崽子，看來也無師自通地學會了很多狩獵的技巧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我說你們很愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"制定那些亂七八糟的規則，然後自己又忍不住打破它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"遊戲在一輪一輪的重複中變得越來越無聊，無所不能的狼之主，反而像人類一樣患得患失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"扎羅，告訴你的同胞，是什麼給我們腳下的這狂歡上了發條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"權力，顯而易見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，一個港口、一個群體、一座城市……有人的地方，就有它的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論是追逐它的、討厭它、恨它的、想要制衡它的，還是像溺水的人摸到一截樹枝一樣，在這個泥潭中痛苦掙扎時無意中摸到它的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後都會握緊它，揮舞它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"權力是真正的狼群。這是敘拉古人……不，所有人類生來就會的狩獵遊戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不需要誰來主持，不需要制定規則……花樣百出，不死不休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像荒野上的風一樣，沒有方向，也不知從何處吹起……但從不停歇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有趣，有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"扎羅，我承認你比我們更早地發現了這裡面的樂趣。所以，你想取消“獠牙”，讓拉普蘭德帶領我們參與這個新遊戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"得看瓦古，阿涅塞，還有那邊幾隻不說話的，到底怎麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿涅塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"認一個人類作頭狼，自狼之主存在，不，自獸主存在以來，都從未有過這樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們也在意尊卑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蠢狼，人類總是舞弄那套概念來困住自己的同胞，你們可是狼之主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果她確實能為我們帶來樂趣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你們忽略了另外一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦古","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們看她腿上的結晶，已經惡化得不能再惡化……對人類來說，礦石病是絕症。一群不死不滅的狼之主，認一個快死的人類作頭狼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……是的，我可能確實沒多久好活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這難道不是新遊戲最有趣的變數嗎，哈哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狼之主們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狼之主們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有種預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扎羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我會度過有生以來最開心的一段時光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿涅塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，大帝找過我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱撒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來不只狼群感受到了那難以言喻的不適……那是某種危機，足以讓所有獸主警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿涅塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝，還有其他異族的同胞，想要找我們談談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿涅塞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然拉普蘭德成為了我們的頭狼，那……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是一刻也閒不下來啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟他們說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"荒野從不失約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g5_courtsquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯小姐，您看看，要是資料沒有問題的話，我就幫您提交了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是當你們的外聘顧問，也要這麼多手續嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂歡節吸引了大量的遊客，起到了很好的宣傳效果，新沃爾西尼港這幾天已經收到了大量的貿易訂單……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來我們的物流系統不僅針對新沃爾西尼本城，還會與敘拉古其他城市，甚至其他國家的移動城市進行貿易合作，我們不敢有一絲懈怠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流的條件很好，但畢竟是一家遠在龍門的物流公司，您作為特別顧問，手續會稍微麻煩一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡簽名就好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎加入新沃爾西尼，德克薩斯小姐，接下來您可能會很忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩一下，將我的申請資料和切利尼娜的一起交上去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又見面了，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你去了哥倫比亞之後，短時間之內不會回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼……田野調查結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sora小姐兩個月前已經開始第二輪敘拉古全境巡迴演唱會了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有注意到本輪的贊助商裡新增了“卡特琳娜文化公司”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和空什麼時候關係那麼好了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也是我的朋友啊，你帶給我的新朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我養好了傷，也收集了不少新靈感，自然是要回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的美好時光已經不在，但不代表我們不可以創造新的更美好的故事……我只是需要一點時間準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這個時機是不是剛剛好？你看起來也做了新的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我們以後要換一種方式相處了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待，切利尼娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g11_newvolsiniipier"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神父？阿格尼爾神父？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是在翻看市民們的狂歡節回顧投稿時，偶然發現了一張您的照片，我都不知道您來了新沃爾西尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我本來就沒有通知任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那您也打算就這麼離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪您一起返回蒙特盧佩吧，有些事情，或許我應該親自向西西里夫人說明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市剛剛邁入第二年，作為市長，你應該還有很多事情要忙才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放輕鬆，年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很不願意承認我們像是那種擔心孩子第一次遠行所以悄悄跟在後面的老傢伙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我來到這座城市，確實是受了西西里的委託，到處走走、看看……必要的時候了結一些人，或者宣布一道她的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我最終什麼都沒有做。狂歡節上發生了一些插曲，但它已經順利落幕了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某種程度上，你確實沒有圓滿完成對西西里的承諾，將新沃爾西尼變成一座完全不同的新城市……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里剛回到敘拉古的時候，遇到的麻煩可是比你現在還多，將銃和秩序帶入這個國家的過程並不順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你的阻力也比她當時的更大。所以她不會就這麼打擊年輕人的熱情……她還不至於變成那樣的老傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想和您一起回蒙特盧佩，並不是為了謝罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一些新的計劃，關於新沃爾西尼的未來、關於推廣《新都市管理法案》的可能性……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，那就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_npc_1541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神父，我有一件事不解，既然您確實是為了解決麻煩而來的……那為什麼，最終您沒有出手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見到了一位老朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"56_g7_tailorshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，翁貝托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……神父，怎麼是您？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然想到你搬來了新沃爾西尼，過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的樣子，你在等人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……家族的殺手，還是獠牙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，死亡總會自己找上門來的，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也已經足夠老了，神父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經很久沒進過教堂，也很久沒為將死之人禱告了，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是個不合格的神父，哈哈……我還記得我們的相識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有想過那次要刺殺的人居然是薩科塔，而且還是一位神父，只是一瞬間的恍神，您已經從長袍底下掏出了一把銃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有您，我也沒辦法重新當回一個裁縫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是過去的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神父，您今天晚上出現在新沃爾西尼，難道狂歡節——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"翁貝托，你還有什麼心願嗎？或許我可以幫你完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，神父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你有個孫子……是叫盧奇諾對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能為他做好所有事情，神父。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那孩子是我僅剩的親人，但我不是他人生裡唯一的親人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"翁貝托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1543_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人總會有他們的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["紅"]}]}
